					<h1 class="s-title">Only 5 Teams Have Overcome A 2-0 Series Deficit In NBA Finals History: Can Spurs Be The 6th?</h1>
		<h2 class="s-tagline">The Spurs will look to take inspiration from the five teams that have come back from a 2-0 deficit in the NBA Finals.</h2>		<div class="single-meta meta-s-dot yes-0">
							<div class="smeta-in">
										<div class="smeta-sec">
												<div class="p-meta">
							<div class="meta-inner is-meta">		<div class="meta-el">
			<a class="meta-author-url meta-author" href="https://fadeawayworld.net/author/gautam-varier">Gautam Varier</a>		</div>
			<div class="meta-el meta-date">
				<time class="date published" datetime="2026-06-06T22:48:17-04:00">Jun 6, 2026</time>
		</div>		<div class="meta-el meta-read">10 Min Read</div>
		</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
								<div class="smeta-extra">
						<div class="t-shared-sec tooltips-n">
			<div class="t-shared-header is-meta">
